        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SBP80, Large Modern Bar Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Large Los Angeles Cabinet Pull has 8 Inch mounting centers and measures 8-1/2 inches long in total. It is a great choice for contemporarily styled kitchens and will look fantastic on larger cabinet doors. This 8 Inch Modern Square Bar Pull is available in a wide array of trend-setting finish colors. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SBP80-specifications.gif?v=1704354709\" width=\"547\" height=\"236\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SBP80 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/small-los-angeles-cabinet-pull-deltana-sbp35\"><b>Deltana SBP35 Small Los Angeles Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SBP80-installed.jpg?v=1704354709\" width=\"297\" height=\"251\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana SBP80 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern 8 Inch Los Angeles Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount: 7/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed either vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SBP80-specifications.pdf?v=1704262367\"><b>Deltana SBP80 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
